{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "6ec4e5b24bc94c7c1faf65595127a66be7ee71e4f7a3d4c79eab685ea8723852", "ja": "同じ舞台で、ともに", "zh": "携手站上同一个舞台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9e133602afe5c80dbf73f456c809bfbbd1cdf498bf4807d2f3c03b95a588377a", "ja": "ついに『屋根裏の道化師』がクランクイン。\n瑞希と紬はこのみの言葉で不安を乗り越え、\n琴葉と桃子はお互いをライバルとして意識\nしつつ、だがそれ以上に、同じ舞台で共演\nできる喜びを感じているのだった。", "zh": "《阁楼里的小丑》终于开镜了。\n在木实的鼓励下，瑞希与䌷克服心中的不安，\n而琴叶与桃子虽将彼此视为对手，\n同时也对于同台共演一事\n感到更大的喜悦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b1e5224e111b31e561bfb32730b44ea967b8b5a3eace6cad159395b93db133a3", "ja": "（今日から、『屋根裏の道化師』がクランクインする。\nみんなそれぞれ、役作りや稽古に励んできたが……）", "zh": "（今天《阁楼里的小丑》正式开镜。\n大家各自忙着融入角色和排演……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "fbc764e96acb35cbcf5c62d53e7a754ae05096f159c660de2ac8b974c7262393", "ja": "いよいよ、撮影開始ですね。\n少し、緊張しています。……どきどき。", "zh": "拍摄终于要开始了。\n我有点紧张……（心跳加速）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dd4c4eeac727e5509027ef1fe994a2290a1c7b2586a5b86b9211f4b2ffa521eb", "ja": "真壁さんも……ですか？\n実は私も、なんだか……。", "zh": "真壁……你也是吗？\n其实，我也觉得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "93e0426af0032b2cb0c25c8a0ff5ab8962695195f4be84163b5d0760c2ce2726", "ja": "大丈夫よ、ふたりとも！　今日まで、\nやれるだけのことは、やってきたんだから。", "zh": "两位，放心吧！\n我们到今天为止已经尽了最大努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "8cf9242d218039f7977062c9a2e55c312469ab0569c0eb84bb0b8ef0fee6ad11", "ja": "あとは、これまでの練習の成果を発揮するだけ。\nリラックスして、楽しんでいきましょう？", "zh": "接下来只要发挥出至今练习的成果就可以了。\n放松心情，乐在其中吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "3d7b805b4e4b4940417c0d6fbdc33ef335610c11d6bc042de4c705878c0136eb", "ja": "そうよね？　{$P$}。", "zh": "你说对吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b3a8407e26373825fa81d3df2424c58f9a83257e87b35c4b5ebb038f239fe36e", "ja": "はい。俺が言おうとしていた事、\nこのみさんに言われてしまいましたね。", "zh": "对啊。\n我想说的话都已经被木实讲完了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "ca91f33c227bd68136d520c070ee9ca4bf5dbe9cf1da344e57517729d1ed684e", "ja": "ウフフ、そう？　でも今回は、大女優役ですもの！\nこれくらいのアドバイスは、できなくちゃね♪", "zh": "呵呵，是吗？不过毕竟我这次是演明星女演员嘛！\n自然要能给出这么棒的建议啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "30b985af0d2862817cda26f78fa0c89394d92e9e9919cb243e7b9eea8bc57d70", "ja": "なるほど。リラックスして、楽しむ。\n……素敵な言葉です。", "zh": "原来如此，放松心情，乐在其中。\n……非常棒的建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "302cad910bbb0a4eda22d72004a0835f69c53be662cf4a156b898ee3d60ba21f", "ja": "そうですね。\n私も、すこし気持ちが楽になったような……。", "zh": "的确如此。\n我的心情似乎也比较轻松了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fc23b2e9a64750fa455407ba11a82eb700be943508ff890113ecdc4f0f0a60ad", "ja": "瑞希、それに紬も、自信を持っていいぞ。\nふたりの努力の成果は、俺が保証するよ。", "zh": "瑞希、䌷，你们要有自信。\n你们俩努力的成果，我能做担保。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1ba7e30e7d4826e51d125b8138979e6198b9cbc2895018cebda474958374cd97", "ja": "はい。……私を探偵役に選んでくださった方に、\n恥ずかしくないお芝居ができるよう、精進いたします。", "zh": "好的……我会努力精进，\n不能辜负了挑选我饰演侦探的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "98078e4b452b72880b312c6db60466dd9207f4f9932e9f1d631079fcb0cc940f", "ja": "そうですね。探偵役の白石さんが謎を解くなら、\n私はたくさんの謎で、お客さんを楽しませてみせます。", "zh": "是啊。白石饰演侦探解开谜团，\n而我就要提供许多谜团，让观众沉浸其中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a9578c8c82e9a838d3a19884da2e6dc5cd3295a5cd52e0734ae43d40ddc6a746", "ja": "ああ！　ふたりとも、期待してるぞ！", "zh": "没错！我很期待你们俩的表现喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "36af277194a465e3e934fcb5ea3aec9cad9cb47c0a6f78ce9e243cf81730dc92", "ja": "えっと、琴葉と桃子は……\nあ、いたいた。", "zh": "我看看，琴叶和桃子在哪里……\n啊，找到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "1a7687105801060ee0fd14614e57c59587a4f5521839b6720d6834de4a8ba505", "ja": "琴葉さん、仕上がりはどう？", "zh": "琴叶姊，练习的成果如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "3c2037ea4545bc6c7961696400d584cc922af53c02a15389b12c847e12dcec51", "ja": "うん。できるだけのことはやったつもり……\n桃子ちゃん、今回は本当にありがとう。", "zh": "嗯，我已经尽我所能练习了……\n桃子，这次真的很感谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "31da75b10b850747e9efa862b46fab15dbcc31311fffdf030a4fd4c1f7b324e3", "ja": "おかげで、役作りにすごく集中できたの。\nだからその分、結果を残さないとだね。", "zh": "多亏有你的建议，我才能全心专注于融入角色。\n所以我也得留下相应的成果才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "575ce6183831bfbbf4ed395b76172021c074fed1a08d80d8a6b0cf39875e63e5", "ja": "お、お礼なんていいってば……。\n桃子は女優として先輩だから、あのくらい当然だし。", "zh": "不、不用道谢啦……\n桃子是演员方面的前辈，给点建议是当然的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "f49c1c53bbd659edbcda4453303085beabe8070dad028fef7b045c2f9a0cd55c", "ja": "でも……琴葉さんと共演するの、楽しみだったから。\n練習がうまくいったのなら、よかったよ。", "zh": "不过……桃子很期待跟琴叶姊同台共演喔。\n听起来练习很顺利，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "136a91953278eb211e6057310b31aaf843244c6e8406df6b9520f20a1e1e02af", "ja": "うん。……ありがとう。\n私も桃子ちゃんと同じ舞台に立てるの、すごく楽しみ。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你。\n能和桃子站上同个舞台，我也很期待喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "1020526d954cd973e2d12fb8080ad7952afa4df29acfa8a34d9abeaa2c5cb095", "ja": "お互い、悔いのないお芝居をしようね。", "zh": "我们都要全力演出，不能留下遗憾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "2354a92f73b150c741cd572f252fc1bd2025021aa10a05b4fdaec4b8c01be65c", "ja": "もちろん！　それに、桃子と琴葉さんが\n共演するんだもん。絶対、名作になるにきまってるよ。", "zh": "那当然！而且，既然是桃子和琴叶同台飙戏，\n这部电影肯定会成为名作啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "ba1508bbe247fc17256083c6fbc074c1c666cf222f537fc1f90b3aa1321025a2", "ja": "でも言っとくけど、お芝居が始まったら\n手加減しないよ。演技なら、絶対桃子が勝つんだから！", "zh": "但是桃子要先声明，开始演戏后，桃子可不会放水喔。\n要比演技，桃子一定会赢的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "b205595ea2898db6934c07559dcfb4671965b7dcc5c2b9c0cba1a42cf260d3e8", "ja": "うん。だけど私も、負けたくないから。\nベストを尽くそうね！", "zh": "嗯，不过，我也不想输呢。\n我们全力以赴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "b8f85551014d633a54b748a57ea5f8cc84d25311c34008eddd56136b5c956c20", "ja": "うん、そうこなくちゃ！　……ふふっ♪", "zh": "嗯，这样就对了！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "0b1348a78248aeb091a46df8e4df905826ad23ffb73c5034826fc7ee930a9c0f", "ja": "（あのふたりには……\nもう俺の言葉は、必要ないみたいだな）", "zh": "（那两个人……\n看来已经不需要我多说什么了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "a7d68f5b1dd42342ba4e4e3e02e265cc2c62cd1486fb0e7ef94a6af6ff1d8871", "ja": "（お互いの力を認め合い、切磋琢磨する……そんな\nふたりの共演は、最高の結果をもたらすだろう！）", "zh": "（肯定对方的实力，相互切磋……\n她们俩同台演出，一定会带来最棒的成果！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
